msgid "To publish the FAQ, place the %1$s block or the %2$s shortcode on the page where it should appear. The questions are shown there and published as FAQPage structured data on that page only; search engines accept FAQ markup only for questions visitors can read."
msgstr "Za objavo pogostih vprašanj postavite blok %1$s ali kratko kodo %2$s na stran, kjer naj bodo prikazana. Vprašanja so tam prikazana in objavljena kot strukturirani podatki FAQPage samo na tej strani; iskalniki sprejemajo oznake FAQ samo za vprašanja, ki jih obiskovalci lahko preberejo."

